# T-BIT LOCAL SECRET BOOTSTRAP
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file is a TEMPLATE for the canonical installation-level secret store.
# The real values are generated automatically by:
#     pnpm run setup:secret              (node scripts/setup-tbit-secret.mjs)
# which creates the actual `.env` at the repository root. Never edit the
# generated secrets by hand; re-run the bootstrap instead.
#
# T-Bit local API key invariant: TBIT_API_KEY and VITE_TBIT_API_KEY are ALWAYS
# identical. The bootstrap guarantees this by writing a single generated value
# to both variables. If both exist but DIFFER, the bootstrap stops with an error
# rather than silently creating a second key.

# --- HMAC signing (independent secret, generated) ---
# TBIT_HMAC_SECRET=<generated 64-char hex>
# TBIT_HMAC_KEY_ID=primary

# --- Payload encryption (independent secret, generated) ---
# TBIT_ENCRYPTION_SECRET=<generated 64-char hex>
# TBIT_ENCRYPTION_KEY_ID=primary

# --- Shared installation-level API key (generated) ---
# TBIT_API_KEY=<generated 64-char hex>
# VITE_TBIT_API_KEY=<THE SAME VALUE as TBIT_API_KEY>

# --- Optional legacy key rotation (see original T-Bit docs) ---
# TBIT_HMAC_PREVIOUS_SECRETS=old-key-id:old-secret-with-at-least-32-characters
# TBIT_ENCRYPTION_PREVIOUS_SECRETS=old-key-id:old-encryption-secret-with-at-least-32-characters